---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Manifesto" currentPath="/manifesto">

  <h1>Manifesto</h1>
  <p class="page-meta">Design philosophy across three movements · February 2026</p>

  <div class="intro">
    <p>The LALINE Manifesto organizes design thinking across three interdependent parts. Foundations establish invisible structural principles. Composition describes how these principles manifest in arrangement. Expression defines the constrained space for creative variation.</p>
    <p>Together, they form a complete methodology for creating timeless artifacts that resist obsolescence.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="parts-list">

    <article class="part-card">
      <div class="part-number">Part I</div>
      <h2><a href="/manifesto/foundations">Foundations</a></h2>
      <p class="part-description">The invisible structural principles that must exist before design begins. These are non-negotiable constraints that create the architecture for everything else.</p>
      <div class="part-principles">
        <span>Restraint</span>
        <span>Authority</span>
        <span>Pacing</span>
        <span>Silence</span>
      </div>
      <div class="part-status">Complete · 4 principles</div>
    </article>

    <article class="part-card">
      <div class="part-number">Part II</div>
      <h2><a href="/manifesto/composition">Composition</a></h2>
      <p class="part-description">How elements exist. The logic of arrangement governing hierarchy, proportion, balance, and unity.</p>
      <div class="part-principles">
        <span>Hierarchy</span>
        <span>Measure</span>
        <span>Balance</span>
        <span>Unity</span>
      </div>
      <div class="part-status">Complete · 4 principles</div>
    </article>

    <article class="part-card">
      <div class="part-number">Part III</div>
      <h2><a href="/manifesto/expression">Expression</a></h2>
      <p class="part-description">How work is revealed. Four expression modes — choose one to be the primary vehicle for meaning.</p>
      <div class="part-principles">
        <span>Visual</span>
        <span>Kinetic</span>
        <span>Verbal</span>
        <span>Spatial</span>
      </div>
      <div class="part-status">Complete · 4 modes</div>
    </article>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  h1 { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }

  .page-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-nav);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-style: italic;
    opacity: 0.6;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .parts-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .part-card {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(42, 42, 37, 0.15);
    padding: 2.5rem 0;
  }

  .part-number {
    font-family: var(--font-nav);
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    opacity: 0.5;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .part-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.65rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .part-card h2 a {
    color: var(--color-text);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .part-card h2 a:hover {
    border-bottom-color: var(--color-text);
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .part-description {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 580px;
  }

  .part-principles {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .part-principles span {
    font-family: var(--font-nav);
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(42, 42, 37, 0.25);
  }

  .part-status {
    font-family: var(--font-nav);
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    font-style: italic;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }
</style>